docs {
  TICK-46. `POST /api/v1/operator/tenants` on nava-onboard (:8081), reached through `tools/tunnels.sh up` at `{{onboard_url}}`. The new admin's first sign-in goes through the tenant's own IdP in a browser, which Bruno cannot drive: the guide runs `TestS4Acceptance` for that part.
}
